# LAMMPS usage (requires 'metal' units):
# pair_style tersoff
# pair_coeff * * ML-Tersoff_Si.tersoff Si
#
# Units: LAMMPS 'metal'
#
# Format:
# i  j  k  m  gamma  lambda3  c  d  cos(theta0)  n  beta
#              lambda2  B  R  D  lambda1  A

Si  Si  Si  1.000000  1.009312  1.381902  120008.5  257.2302  -0.216959  1.398685  0.443621  1.013955  54.20208  3.354009  0.622883  3.039371  1663.927